{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The all-new S2.4: Raid for Riches is live now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Void Abyss calls to the bold: fighters, treasure hunters, and explorers. If &quot;high risk, high reward&quot; is your creed, you'll leave its depths with coffers overflowing. Remember, only those who survive the Abyss carry their spoils home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break a leg, Driftmaster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warborne Above Ashes is a top-down PvP loot-and-extract MMO.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Driftmaster roaming the galaxy. Time and again, you dive into the perilous Void Abyss in search of treasure and ever-greater power. Its inhabitants are hardly welcoming\u2026 but far more dangerous than the creatures are the hearts of men. Evacuate in one piece, trade your spoils, and grow ever stronger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142050/extras/773e75e74563ddc7cc96d33129eaedc5.poster.avif?t=1773369450\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142050/extras/773e75e74563ddc7cc96d33129eaedc5.webm?t=1773369450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142050/extras/773e75e74563ddc7cc96d33129eaedc5.mp4?t=1773369450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MMO + DMZ: Claim what you can, then get out fast!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High risk, high reward:</strong> Danger and opportunity lurk around every corner. Your gear, scavenging route, and battle tactics are all high-stakes bets. Remember: live, and you walk away with gold; die, and your fate turns cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery &amp; Excitement:</strong> Fog blankets the land, hiding friend and foe alike. Each venture brims with danger, and endless possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-layered Maps:</strong> Charge into battle or slip unseen to plunder treasure\u2014there's a place for every strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142050/extras/0b35a0c30abd006c480008e368dd0309.poster.avif?t=1773369450\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142050/extras/0b35a0c30abd006c480008e368dd0309.webm?t=1773369450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142050/extras/0b35a0c30abd006c480008e368dd0309.mp4?t=1773369450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To Fight or to Fight, There Is No Question</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Builds:</strong> Recruit over 40 unique Drifters, mix and match from a vast array of equipment and dozens of tactical items to forge a combat style all your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill is Power:</strong> Master your skills, exploit terrain, and perfect your movement. Every decision can turn the tide. Bring out your A-game and fight!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps